Preprocessing runtime — third-party components
==============================================

The image "preprocess" feature (digital-art enhancement before tracing) uses
the following third-party components, fetched by `make preprocess-setup`
(see scripts/fetch-preprocess.sh). They are NOT committed to this repository.

1. realesrgan-ncnn-vulkan (inference binary)
   - Project: https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN-ncnn-vulkan (v0.2.0)
   - License: MIT (Copyright (c) 2021 Xintao Wang)
   - Built on ncnn (https://github.com/Tencent/ncnn, BSD 2-Clause) and
     MoltenVK (Vulkan for macOS, BSD 3-Clause).

2. realesrgan-x4plus-anime-x4 (ncnn model, "digital art" enhancement)
   - Project: https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN (v0.2.2.4 release)
   - Paper: "Real-ESRGAN: Training Real-World Blind Super-Resolution with
     Pure Synthetic Data" (Wang et al., ICCVW 2021)
   - Model weights: RealESRGAN_x4plus_anime_6B, converted to ncnn format.
   - Same model family as the "digital art" model shipped with Upscayl.

Attribution: this software includes Real-ESRGAN (MIT) and ncnn (BSD-2).
